stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> DeviceOpening: open /dev/cdc-wdm0
    DeviceOpening --> Initializing
    Initializing --> SimAuth: SIM present
    SimAuth --> Registering
    Registering --> DataConnecting
    DataConnecting --> Connected: PDP context up
    Connected --> DataDisconnecting: disconnect
    DataDisconnecting --> Idle
    Connected --> Error: modem fault
    Error --> Idle: reset

    Connected: emit QmiConnectionEvent
    Connected: emit cellular.wan_ready
    Connected: output wan port to VPN components
